+Module	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:61	reference-semantics/semantics/core.k:49-60,124-127	Concrete execution loads the exact submitted module; proof starts after definition with a pinned closure.	Accepted; module load has no result-bearing computation beyond binding the closure.
+FuncDef	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:53	reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k:14-16	Proof multiplyClosure has the identical parameter/body tokens and defining environment 0.	Accepted; body mutation makes the proof fail.
+Params	reference-semantics/semantics/syntax.k:57	reference-semantics/semantics/functions.k:14-16,63-66; call.k:69-74	Submitted ("a","b") equals proof closure ("a","b"); arguments bind left-to-right.	Accepted.
